<%= @incident.severity.upcase %> — <%= @incident.title %>

Opened <%= @incident.opened_at.utc.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC") %> by the <%= @incident.check_name.humanize.downcase %> check.

<% if @detail.any? -%>
WHAT THE CHECK SAW
<% @detail.each do |key, value| -%>
  <%= key.to_s.humanize %>: <%= value.is_a?(Enumerable) ? value.to_json : value %>
<% end -%>

<% end -%>
Acknowledge (stops the repeat pages, leaves the incident open):
  <%= @incident.ack_url %>

All open incidents:
  <%= @incident.console_url %>
